// expect: Format.Depth is a target with no color image, so it's a target's only format
// expect: every target has depth beside its color images, which 'target.depth' reads: 'RenderTarget.Window(Format.Rgba8, Format.Rgba16f)' holds two colors and its depth
scene Main { }
view Show() { var target = RenderTarget.Window(0.5, Format.Rgba16f, Format.Depth); }
